{"t":"QNT","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Quantinuum Inc.","ko":"퀀티뉴엄","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","employees":800,"hq":"Broomfield, CO, United States","website":"https://www.quantinuum.com","summary_en":"Quantinuum Inc. manufactures and develops quantum computing hardware and software in United States and Internationally. The company develops a quantum computing platform that offers solutions, such as hardware platforms, developer tools, application libraries, and solution-targeted intellectual property. Its integrated quantum computing platform combines quantum hardware systems and middleware with application software designed to make quantum computing deployable in real-world environments. The company was founded in 2021 and is based in Broomfield, Colorado.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Quantinuum Inc.는 미국 및 전 세계에서 양자 컴퓨팅 하드웨어 및 소프트웨어를 제조 및 개발합니다. 하드웨어 플랫폼, 개발자 도구, 애플리케이션 라이브러리, 솔루션 대상 지적재산권 등 솔루션을 제공하는 양자컴퓨팅 플랫폼을 개발한다. 통합 양자 컴퓨팅 플랫폼은 양자 하드웨어 시스템과 미들웨어를 실제 환경에 양자 컴퓨팅을 배포할 수 있도록 설계된 애플리케이션 소프트웨어와 결합합니다. 이 회사는 2021년에 설립되었으며 콜로라도주 브룸필드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":30.0,"mcap":8036826624.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-17.321415,"peg":null,"ps":274.21954,"pb":2.8615031,"ev_ebitda":-2.424,"div":0.0,"beta":null,"hi52":86.79,"lo52":27.11},"fin":{"rev":29308000.0,"rev_g":2.333,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.46703997,"op":-28.335129,"net":0.0,"roe":null,"fcf":null,"cash":1936114048.0,"debt":31995000.0,"de":1.096,"eps":-0.43,"feps":-1.73196},"own":{"short":null,"inst":0.76265,"insider":0.058569998},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":71.15385,"median":60.0,"high":155.0,"low":50.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.21429,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[